  "description": "Dazzling and magnetic, she’s the main character wherever she goes, always surrounded by men. For Seo Ju-in, five years of friendship has meant five years of nursing a one-sided love. Even after all this time, watching her get tangled up with other guys still makes his heart ache. Then one night over drinks, she kisses him. What could possibly be going through her mind? In her eyes, who does she really see?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
